OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FMohammed is back about his swollen
OL,7,     Fleg, which is getting more painful
OL,8,     Fand now makes walking difficult.
OL,9,     FOther cases include a worrying
OL,10,     Farmpit lump, and long-term
OL,11,     Fdepression and anxiety.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FA man named Terry, who fell off a
OL,14,     Froof and is seriously injured,
OL,15,     Fneeds help. A man named Jeff is
OL,16,     Fbrought in by ambulance after his
OL,17,     Fcar flipped onto its side.
