OL,5,G0100 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FIn Birmingham, Barry worries the
OL,7,     Fcondition affecting his hands will
OL,8,     Fstop him doing the activities he
OL,9,     Floves, and Dr Abdul-Razaak lends
OL,10,     Fan ear to David who is suffering
OL,11,     Ffrom depression.
