OL,14,     F49-year-old man rushed in by
OL,15,     Fambulance. A 58-year-old woman has
OL,16,     Fa life-threatening allergic
OL,17,     Freaction to nuts. An 86-year-old
OL,18,     Fman has an arm injury.
